@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Register User (Run once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Junior Developer",
  "email": "juniordeveloper@figzol.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Login User (Captures token automatically!)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juniordeveloper@figzol.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Create Weather-Enriched Plan (Captures plan ID automatically!)
# @name createPlan
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Client Onboarding & API Demo",
  "city": "Islamabad",
  "plan_date": "2026-11-28",
  "notes": "Prepare deployment checklist and review database schema"
}

### 5. Get All User Plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 6. Update Plan City & Details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{createPlan.response.body.plan.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Q4 Product Roadmap Sync",
  "city": "London",
  "plan_date": "2026-12-03",
  "notes": "Finalize sprint milestones with remote engineering team"
}

### 7. Delete Plan
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{createPlan.response.body.plan.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 8. Security Test: Cross-User Isolation (User B tries to access User A's plan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Second User",
  "email": "userb@figzol.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
# @name loginUserB
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "userb@figzol.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### User B tries to read User A's plan ID (Should return 404 Plan not found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{createPlan.response.body.plan.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUserB.response.body.token}}

### 9. Edge Case: Duplicate Email Registration (Should return 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate User",
  "email": "lead@figzol.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 10. Edge Case: Invalid City Lookup (Should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Impossible Trip",
  "city": "NotARealCityXYZ999",
  "plan_date": "2026-12-10"
}

### 11. Security Test: Missing Auth Header (Should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans